S[117] = "6.4 Flow–stock reconciliation"
S[118] = ("Flow and stock measures are both affected by the same conventions. The trajectory agreement and the temporal holdout support treating time-varying gestation and broad intangibles as useful accounting corrections, without implying that CWON is ground truth. A practical route for the Beyond-GDP agenda is therefore to audit flow-side capital for timing and coverage assumptions before comparing it with wealth accounts. Natural extensions include asset-specific lag drift, time-varying ⟦β⟧, interactions between lags and depreciation, and cyclical variation in effective gestation, which the present analysis does not identify.")
